   204	/** Where a claim stands. Only OPEN, PENDING and SETTLED claims count toward the totals; a PENDING claim
   205	 *  (settled by a clerk above the clerk limit, awaiting a steward) is handled as an OPEN one, and a
   206	 *  statement binds it like any other claim that counts. A DELETED claim (a deleted DRAFT) counts nowhere,
   207	 *  and may be restored to a DRAFT only on the sheet's today it was deleted (see {@link CheckClerkLimit}).
   208	 *  A REVIEW claim (opened while its due is above the review threshold in force on its date) awaits a
   209	 *  steward's review, which makes it OPEN; until then it counts in no total and has no number. */
   210	public enum ClaimStatus {
   211	    DRAFT, OPEN, PENDING, SETTLED, VOID, DELETED, REVIEW;
