   213	    /** Whether a claim may move from this status to {@code next}: DRAFT to OPEN, OPEN to PENDING or
   214	     *  SETTLED, PENDING to SETTLED (approved) or OPEN (rejected), and DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING to VOID;
   215	     *  SETTLED to VOID too, though only a steward within days of settling it (see {@link CheckClerkLimit}).
   216	     *  DRAFT to DELETED, and DELETED back to DRAFT (restored). DRAFT to REVIEW (opened above the review
   217	     *  threshold), REVIEW to OPEN (reviewed) or VOID. VOID is final. */
